# INVWINDX.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: drags of the
# split view's item 1 that end with nothing done.  ESC ends one, the
# release after it moving nothing, and the tree's selection stays on
# Office, whose contents ENTER on the tree then opens; F1's help
# window ends one as it opens, its release after ESC moving nothing.  A
# right click during a drag is dropped: no pop-up, the selection kept,
# the drop still to come, which moves the item to Shelf A1.  ALT-F
# during a drag opens no menu, and ESC then ends it.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINDX.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/dragchk.py checks
# it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-L B
S LOCS
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 0 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 1
S ESCOVER
K ESC
S ESCED
M 208.1 UP ROW 1
S ESCUP
K ESC
K ENTER
S ESCOPEN
K ESC
S ESCBACK
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 0 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 1
K F1
S F1HELP
K ESC
M 208.1 UP ROW 1
S F1UP
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 0 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 1
M 221.1 RDOWN ROW 2
M 221.1 RUP ROW 2
S RIGHT
M 208.1 UP ROW 1
S RIGHTUP
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 0 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 2
K ALT-F
S ALTF
K ESC
S ALTESC
M 208.1 UP ROW 2
S ALTUP
K ALT-F X
